| H5 | a NUL byte late in a large text file; a UTF-16 text file | R7 cell (`docs/late.txt`, `docs/wide.txt`), mutant `r7-first-four-bytes-only` |
| H6 | a `filter` attribute in a macro line `[attr]x filter=lfs`, in a nested `.gitattributes`, in capitals, bare | R8 cell, mutants `r8-*` (3) |
| H7 | an edit of `ci.yml` outside the two jobs (six shapes the earlier reviews measured green), a second workflow file | gap rows (7): green at BASE, red after C2 |
| H8 | a `cat-file -p` that prints nothing with rc 0; a listing without an object only another ref reaches; a listing with no final line end; the first copy's plain line cut; the second copy's block cut | `scan_faults.py` rows; BASE's step green on four of them (the gap shown) |
| H9 | an object reachable only by a kind of ref the checkout does not fetch (a git note) | named limit, unchanged (README S1) |
